.TH VT 1
.SH NAME
vt \- VT100-style terminal emulator window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/vt
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Vt
is a Wm-hosted terminal emulator window, interpreting a useful subset
of VT100/ANSI escape sequences (cursor movement, scrolling regions,
colour) over a
.B /dev/cons
connected to a freshly spawned shell.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/vt.b
